			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401290801,
					"content": "祖莉亚夫人，菲米尼，我们先来画画吧？比起王冠，我更想看看绘本的新内容！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290802,
					"content": "其实是在期待派蒙女神的样子吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290803
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290803,
					"content": "哎呀！你知道就行了，不用一定说出来的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290804,
					"content": "哈哈，好，我知道了，那么今天的故事应该是这样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亚·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290805,
					"content": "在历经千难万险后，王子与他的勇者们终于抵达了水妖王国的入口。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亚·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290806,
					"content": "这时，同伴中的小精灵派蒙，向大家展现了她的真实身份——一位隐藏的女神。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亚·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290807,
					"content": "好耶！女神出场了！女神大大赞扬了勇者们的诚实，作为奖励，她洒下好多好多祝福，然后还许愿王子一定能够完成目标！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290808,
					"content": "沐浴在女神的荣耀下，王子与勇者冲入了邪恶的巢穴，驱逐了魔物，拯救了被关押的可爱水妖。王子终于夺回了王国，但王冠…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亚·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290809,
					"content": "哎呀，王冠还没有做好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290810,
					"content": "不…王冠就在那，逃跑的魔物将它秘密带走了，邪恶仍不死心。但王子很快就会夺回王冠，绚烂的彩虹会重新降临在王国中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290811,
					"content": "唔…这个解释…很有代入感！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290812,
					"content": "哇，真好…祖莉亚夫人画得真好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290813,
					"content": "谢谢，这下绘本的第二页也完成了，「特尔克西」的历险离终点越来越近，他会加冕为王…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亚·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290814,
					"content": "而我的孩子，你一定也会在那时振作起来吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亚·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290815,
					"content": "-.-  ..-.   ..-  -...  .---  -.  ..-. -.  -...  -.  -...  ---",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「特尔克西」"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290816,
					"content": "一定会的，祖莉亚夫人！而且，说不定今天你回家后，就能听见医生的好消息了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290817,
					"content": "借您吉言，女神大人。对了，菲米尼先生，关于王冠的制作…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亚·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290818,
					"content": "一天的时间足够了，请放心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290819,
					"content": "麻烦你了，那么最后的历险，就还放在两天后吧，大家仍然在这里集合，好吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亚·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290820,
					"content": "没问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290821
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290821,
					"content": "那两天后见了，可爱的朋友们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亚·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290837,
					"content": "♪♫♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "祖莉亚·德斯特雷"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290822,
					"content": "哎呀，夫人回去了，我们差不多也该回去了，菲米尼还有工作要做吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290823,
					"content": "嗯，我待会要去城里买一些零件，用来制作王冠的底座。我打算做几个不同的方案，然后选出最合适的那个。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290824,
						401290825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290824,
					"content": "菲米尼很认真。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290826
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290825,
					"content": "菲米尼很努力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290826
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290826,
					"content": "是呀，我以前只知道菲米尼不会轻易接受别人的委托，没想到一旦接受了委托会这么用心呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290827,
					"content": "…可能…因为…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290828,
					"content": "什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290829,
					"content": "因为…我希望…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290830
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290830,
					"content": "哎呀，怎么吞吞吐吐的，那是什么表情呀？感觉立刻就要脸红戴上头盔躲起来了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290831,
					"content": "啊！我脸红了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290832,
					"content": "不要为难菲米尼了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290833
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290833,
					"content": "嘿嘿，好啦，菲米尼，那今天就不打扰你的工作了哦，我们两天后再见吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290834,
					"content": "…谢谢…好…两天后见…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290835
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401290835,
					"content": "两天后见。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401290836
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401290836,
					"content": "…我希望，所有身处困境的人们，都能看到美好的东西，都能看到奇迹…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				}
			]
